      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DESPICABLE NITRO (1) has missed the frame the last couple but just a few runs back pushed the clock when winning over 324m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in a solid 17.66. Looks the one to beat on best figures. ZIPPING KEPIL (8) was out of the placings last time when fifth at this track (17.75) but scored four back at this track (17.73). Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Should be in this for a long way. CHEVY THE BEAST (6) was well fancied last time on the strength of a win two back but could only manage fourth (17.92) at Taree Super Track. One of the better chances. KID KERMARO (4) picked up a cheque when public elect last time - in the mix again.",
